# Installed in dom0 at /etc/qubes/policy.d/30-dev-shell.policy.
#
# Grants @DEV_VM@ unrestricted root shell in dom0. Sorts before the shipped
# 90-default.policy, so this line wins.
#
# `allow` means no prompt: an agent, and anything that reaches an agent, runs
# in dom0 unattended. Swap to `ask` to require a dom0 confirmation per call.
#
# Format: SERVICE ARGUMENT SOURCE DESTINATION ACTION
dev.Shell	*	@DEV_VM@	dom0	allow
